  "For an academic thesis investigating the balance between rights and innovation in the EU AI Action Plan. Insert "Thesis Code Scraper Draft" - I want this code to improve in order to scrape about 1000 documents from eurolex and EU parliament/commission/ENISA , everything that discusses the AI Action Plan or AI legislation. Explain to me exactly what every line does. Keep it ethically correct by including: ua_string <- "BSoG_Thesis_AIactionplan_Scraper/1.0 (academic; contact: veco.Julian.Ter.Hedde@vub.be)",
